What:           /sys/class/power_supply/battery/device/fast_charge
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        moe-takasaki <199255379+moe-takasaki@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
                Reads mode (usb, pd-buck, pps-start, pps-pump, pps-buck),
                PPS permission, negotiated/requested voltages and last error.
                Root writes 0/1 to disable/permit PPS pump requests. Disabling
                stops the pump before returning to fixed PD. A new permission
                write clears the per-attachment failure latch for testing.
                Fixed PD negotiation remains owned by TCPM.

